SOLS 24/7 is an award-winning humanitarian organization, committed to serve, educate and empower poor and underserved communities. To the communities we serve, we provide the opportunity to rise above their circumstances and take control of their lives through education. To our team members, we provide the opportunity to be the best version of themselves.
Through various education and social empowerment programs, we work unconditionally towards transforming underserved communities to develop their true potential and break the cycle of poverty. Using revolutionary and custom-designed models – Science of Languages, Science of Technology and Science of Life – our organization provides free education and social empowerment programs to underserved communities in Malaysia.
SOLS 24/7 Foundation is a tax-exempted, not-for-profit organization, registered in Malaysia.

